⫻display/header:
  Subject: Live Gemini Invoke (KickGuard consent)

⫻display/content:
Click CONSENT & INVOKE in the QML6 bar. KickGuard will not call generativelanguage.googleapis.com until that click.
Requires GEMINI_API_KEY or GOOGLE_API_KEY (scripts/run.sh writes a runtime env file; the C++ host reads the env var).
